# Game_Stopwatch — Multi-Player Stopwatch (ID 10)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Stopwatch.h, Game_Stopwatch.cpp
# HTML: data/game_stopwatch_setup.html, game_stopwatch_names.html, game_stopwatch_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Competitive stopwatch. Players press pucks to start/stop timing. Central start option with synchronized countdown. Lap mode for multiple splits. Hold-to-start readiness check.

## CONFIG
- numPlayers, centralStart, holdToStart, lapMode

## STATES
SW_SETUP → SW_WAIT_HANDS → SW_COUNTDOWN (3s, SKI) → SW_RUNNING → SW_FINISHED
Optional: SW_FALSE_START

## KEY MECHANICS
- Central start: all start simultaneously after countdown
- Non-central: individual start/stop per player
- Lap mode: click = record lap, double-click within 1s = finish
- Action queue: non-blocking scheduled light/sound effects
- Flash reset: 150ms visual feedback
- 10 distinct player colors

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_num, cfg_central, cfg_hold, cfg_lap, start_all, stop_all, stop_one, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, central, lap, players: [{id, state, holding, falseStart, time, laps: [...]}]}
